{"id":118195318373192,"type":"artist","name":"XTC","artist":null,"year":1976,"weight":79,"info":{"tags":["new wave","post-punk","80s","pop","alternative"],"country":"GB","begin":"1976","end":"2006","kind":"Group","similar":["Elvis Costello & The Attractions","Andy Partridge","Squeeze","Prefab Sprout","Devo","Talking Heads","Elvis Costello","Orange Juice","Oingo Boingo","Magazine"],"disambiguation":"English rock band","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/XTC_bandphoto.jpg?width=500","bio":"XTC fue banda de rock, pop y new wave, nacida a partir del movimiento punk de finales de los años 70, originaria de la ciudad de Swindon, Inglaterra.\n\nSe mantuvo activa entre 1977 y 2005, caracterizándose por una permanente evolución, desde sus inicios \"cuasi punk\" hasta sus últimos trabajos caracterizados por los soberbios arreglos instrumentales y vocales, y sus notables letras.\n\nNunca disfrutó de grandes éxitos comerciales, pese a que tuvo algunos reconocimientos en los rankings del Reino Unido y Canadá"},"works":[{"id":164083100392891,"type":"album","name":"Go 2","artist":"XTC","year":1978,"weight":3,"yt":"7E21z1oluwM","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":223412012833492,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Zolo","rank":87,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":69839202409312,"type":"song","name":"Making Plans for Nigel","artist":"XTC","year":1978,"weight":13,"yt":"n-X3Wy-svIY","src":"books,ensayos","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[{"name":"The Ongoing History of New Music","n":2}],"lists":[],"n_lists":0}},{"id":234411559887875,"type":"album","name":"White Music","artist":"XTC","year":1978,"weight":18,"yt":"nNnmPQ2284w","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":65232636722211,"name":"Scaruffi 1970s","rank":150,"scaruffi":7.5},{"id":2234120128334